<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT WALES 37-20.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT WALES 37-20.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Wales 37-20 (halftime 23-12) in a rugby union test at Cardiff Arms Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>South Africa - Tries: Joost van der Westhuizen (3), Andre Joubert, Jacques Olivier. Conversions: Henry Honiball (2), Joubert. Penalties: Honiball (2)</p>
<p>Wales - Try: Arwel Thomas. Penalties: Neil Jenkins (5)</p>
